y=\"1 of 3 included alternative album covers.\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6ab09c2043ba16c77bec74be/6ab3d8aff6323daaf60b18c3_cd-front.webp\" alt=\"alternative cover, om\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dots\" id=\"dots\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"views\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"product\">\n    <p>tazparis — from paris, with love.</p>\n    <p class=\"cap-title\" id=\"cap-title\" hidden></p>\n    <p class=\"desc\" id=\"cap-copy\"></p>\n    <p class=\"price\">$80</p>\n    <a class=\"buy\" href=\"https://ysrtvh-pa.myshopify.com/cart/49227493146807:1\" rel=\"noopener\">buy</a>\n    <p class=\"fine\">ships from brooklyn</p>\n  </section>\n</main>",
